    "_comment": "mermaid.initialize({theme:'base', themeVariables:{darkMode:true, ...}}) in mermaid.js. darkMode has to sit inside themeVariables \u2014 mermaidAPI hands only config.themeVariables to base.getThemeVariables(), so a root-level darkMode is never seen by the theme.",
